/-!
# Trailing 15-Tick Window Body & Native Block Heads, Part 1 (`Shadow15EndNative`)

Unifies all 4 trailing 15-tick blocks (`j : Fin 4`, `s ∈ {365, 380, 395, 410}`):
- `j = 0` (`365`): re-entry after 20-tick block `k9` (`345`), packing `345..354` (`packW d 365 350 ++ packW d 365 355`)
  and archiving `k9`'s last 10 ticks via `archiveLoadP20 k9 d`.
- `j = 1, 2, 3` (`380, 395, 410`): packing `s - 15..s - 11` (`packW d s (s - 10)`) and archiving
  block `j - 1`'s last 10 ticks via `archiveLoadP15E (j - 1) d`.

Proves `body15E_run`, `ext_head15E`, `body15E_keeps`, `after_encoded15E`, `pack_source_law15E`,
`admits15E`, `admin15E`, `next_window15E`, `saved_with_pending15E`, and `real_receipt15E`.
