/-!
# Trailing 15-Tick Shadow Leave Semantics, Part B1 (`Inputs15E` & `core15E_result`)

Complete, zero-placeholder forward semantics for the core of all 4 trailing 15-tick leave blocks
(`j : Fin 4`, `s ∈ {365, 380, 395, 410}`):
1. `Inputs15E`, `recordedParity15E`, `recordedEvents15E`, `entry15E_mask`, `entry15E_parity`.
2. `kept8_15E_run`, `schedule15E_ok`, `live15E_row`, `clrAll15E_basis_at`.
3. `core15E_result`: `before15E ++ barrel15E false ++ fix8P15E ++ keptG ++ wordGM ++ fix10P15E ++ leaveFix11 ++ leaveFix12 ++ lowSign15E`.
-/

