/-!
# Trailing 15-Tick Shadow Leave Semantics, Part B1b (`beforeStore15E_result` & `whole15E_result`)

Complete forward semantics for the tail of `leaveUnred15E j` (`j : Fin 4`, `s ∈ {365, 380, 395, 410}`):
