2. `pending15E_eval`, `pending15E_far`, `nextFlag15E_orientation`, `nextFlag15E_boundNear`.
3. `beforeStore15E_result`: `Companion.restore` + `releaseMaskP15E` + `leaveStoreMapped15E`.
4. `whole15E_result`: `leaveLowClose15E` + `closeFlag15E` (`Shadow7.parity_run`) + `swapsG (moves15E s)`.
-/

