/-!
# Trailing 15-Tick Shadow Leave Clean, Frame History & Certified Cuts (`Shadow15EndCutC2`)

Closes the end-to-end forward step for all 4 trailing 15-tick blocks (`j : Fin 4`, `s ∈ {365, 380, 395, 410}`):
1. `zeros15E`, `boundaryClean15E`: every retired scratch and B-top wire in `zeros15E j` is `false` after `leaveP15E j`.
2. `releasedSite15E`, `leftovers15E`, `releasedOrigin15E`, `releasedActual15E`, `frameHistory15E`.
3. `assembleCut15E_next` (`j < 3` → `EnterJ15E ⟨j+1, _⟩`) and `assembleCut15E_exit425` (`j = 3` → `Portal425Flag`).
4. `endpoint15E_next` and `endpoint15E_exit425` (stated directly for reduced `leaveP15E j`).
-/

