  · exact mem_jp760_of_r q (List.mem_append_left _ hl)
  · rw [ho]; exact mem_jp760_of_eq 1043 rfl (by omega)
  · rw [hp]; exact mem_jp760_of_eq 784 rfl (by omega)
  · exact carry254_in_jp q hc.1

